BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:“Uncovering New London” History Tours in Celebration of Americ
 a 250
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260522
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261010
DTSTAMP:20260905T134019Z
UID:7b05ac2e6c98cc2886a522babef2@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:In celebration of America’s 250th anniversary\, Uncovering N
 ew London Tours invites residents and visitors to explore the city’s ric
 h history through engaging guided walking and bus tours. Discover New Lond
 on’s role in the American Revolution\, its whaling heritage\, Black hist
 ory\, Gilded Age influence\, and hidden gems\, brought to life by knowledg
 eable local docents. Tours are available for groups of all sizes\, and can
  be customized to fit any schedule\, with optional stops and dining experi
 ences. A unique and immersive way to experience the stories that shaped th
 e Whaling City.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/uncovering-new-londo
 n-history-tours-celebration-america-250
LOCATION:Downtown New London\, 27 Water St\, New London CT\, 06320
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/uncovering-new-london-history-tours-celebra
 tion-america-250
END:VEVENT
